{"n":69,"name":"Al-Haqqah","nameAr":"الحاقة","meaning":"The Reality","ayahs":52,"place":"makkah","bismillah":true,"ayat":[{"n":1,"juz":29,"ar":"ٱلْحَآقَّةُ","en":"The Inevitable Reality -","w":[{"ar":"ٱلْحَآقَّةُ","tr":"al-ḥāqatu","en":"The Inevitable Reality","root":"حقق","lem":"حاقَّة"}]},{"n":2,"juz":29,"ar":"مَا ٱلْحَآقَّةُ","en":"What is the Inevitable Reality?","w":[{"ar":"مَا","tr":"mā","en":"What"},{"ar":"ٱلْحَآقَّةُ","tr":"l-ḥāqatu","en":"(is) the Inevitable Reality","root":"حقق","lem":"حاقَّة"}]},{"n":3,"juz":29,"ar":"وَمَآ أَدْرَىٰكَ مَا ٱلْحَآقَّةُ","en":"And what can make you know what is the Inevitable Reality?","w":[{"ar":"وَمَآ","tr":"wamā","en":"And what"},{"ar":"أَدْرَىٰكَ","tr":"adrāka","en":"will make you know","root":"دري","lem":"أَدْرَى"},{"ar":"مَا","tr":"mā","en":"what"},{"ar":"ٱلْحَآقَّةُ","tr":"l-ḥāqatu","en":"(is) the Inevitable Reality","root":"حقق","lem":"حاقَّة"}]},{"n":4,"juz":29,"ar":"كَذَّبَتْ ثَمُودُ وَعَادٌۢ بِٱلْقَارِعَةِ","en":"Thamūd and ʿAad denied the Striking Calamity [i.e., the Resurrection].","w":[{"ar":"كَذَّبَتْ","tr":"kadhabat","en":"Denied","root":"كذب","lem":"كَذَّبَ"},{"ar":"ثَمُودُ","tr":"thamūdu","en":"Thamud"},{"ar":"وَعَادٌۢ","tr":"waʿādun","en":"and Aad","root":"عود","lem":"عاد"},{"ar":"بِٱلْقَارِعَةِ","tr":"bil-qāriʿati","en":"the Striking Calamity","root":"قرع","lem":"قارِعَة"}]},{"n":5,"juz":29,"ar":"فَأَمَّا ثَمُودُ فَأُهْلِكُوا۟ بِٱلطَّاغِيَةِ","en":"So as for Thamūd, they were destroyed by the overpowering [blast].","w":[{"ar":"فَأَمَّا","tr":"fa-ammā","en":"So as for"},{"ar":"ثَمُودُ","tr":"thamūdu","en":"Thamud"},{"ar":"فَأُهْلِكُوا۟","tr":"fa-uh'likū","en":"they were destroyed","root":"هلك","lem":"أَهْلَكَ"},{"ar":"بِٱلطَّاغِيَةِ","tr":"bil-ṭāghiyati","en":"by the overpowering (blast)","root":"طغي","lem":"طاغِيَة"}]},{"n":6,"juz":29,"ar":"وَأَمَّا عَادٌ فَأُهْلِكُوا۟ بِرِيحٍ صَرْصَرٍ عَاتِيَةٍ","en":"And as for ʿAad, they were destroyed by a screaming, violent wind","w":[{"ar":"وَأَمَّا","tr":"wa-ammā","en":"And as for"},{"ar":"عَادٌۭ","tr":"ʿādun","en":"Aad","root":"عود","lem":"عاد"},{"ar":"فَأُهْلِكُوا۟","tr":"fa-uh'likū","en":"they were destroyed","root":"هلك","lem":"أَهْلَكَ"},{"ar":"بِرِيحٍۢ","tr":"birīḥin","en":"by a wind","root":"روح","lem":"رِيح"},{"ar":"صَرْصَرٍ","tr":"ṣarṣarin","en":"screaming","root":"صرصر","lem":"صَرْصَر"},{"ar":"عَاتِيَةٍۢ","tr":"ʿātiyatin","en":"violent","root":"عتو","lem":"عاتِيَة"}]},{"n":7,"juz":29,"ar":"سَخَّرَهَا عَلَيْهِمْ سَبْعَ لَيَالٍ وَثَمَـٰنِيَةَ أَيَّامٍ حُسُومًا فَتَرَى ٱلْقَوْمَ فِيهَا صَرْعَىٰ كَأَنَّهُمْ أَعْجَازُ نَخْلٍ خَاوِيَةٍ","en":"Which He [i.e., Allāh] imposed upon them for seven nights and eight days in succession, so you would see the people therein fallen as if they were hollow trunks of palm trees.","w":[{"ar":"سَخَّرَهَا","tr":"sakharahā","en":"Which He imposed","root":"سخر","lem":"سَخَّرَ"},{"ar":"عَلَيْهِمْ","tr":"ʿalayhim","en":"upon them"},{"ar":"سَبْعَ","tr":"sabʿa","en":"(for) seven","root":"سبع","lem":"سَبْع"},{"ar":"لَيَالٍۢ","tr":"layālin","en":"nights","root":"ليل","lem":"لَيْل"},{"ar":"وَثَمَـٰنِيَةَ","tr":"wathamāniyata","en":"and eight","root":"ثمن","lem":"ثَمانِيَة"},{"ar":"أَيَّامٍ","tr":"ayyāmin","en":"days","root":"يوم","lem":"يَوْم"},{"ar":"حُسُومًۭا","tr":"ḥusūman","en":"(in) succession","root":"حسم","lem":"حُسُوم"},{"ar":"فَتَرَى","tr":"fatarā","en":"so you would see","root":"رأي","lem":"رَأَى"},{"ar":"ٱلْقَوْمَ","tr":"l-qawma","en":"the people","root":"قوم","lem":"قَوْم"},{"ar":"فِيهَا","tr":"fīhā","en":"therein"},{"ar":"صَرْعَىٰ","tr":"ṣarʿā","en":"fallen","root":"صرع","lem":"صَرْعَى"},{"ar":"كَأَنَّهُمْ","tr":"ka-annahum","en":"as if they were"},{"ar":"أَعْجَازُ","tr":"aʿjāzu","en":"trunks","root":"عجز","lem":"أَعْجاز"},{"ar":"نَخْلٍ","tr":"nakhlin","en":"(of) date-palms","root":"نخل","lem":"نَخْل"},{"ar":"خَاوِيَةٍۢ","tr":"khāwiyatin","en":"hollow","root":"خوي","lem":"خاوِيَة"}]},{"n":8,"juz":29,"ar":"فَهَلْ تَرَىٰ لَهُم مِّنۢ بَاقِيَةٍ","en":"Then do you see of them any remains?","w":[{"ar":"فَهَلْ","tr":"fahal","en":"Then do"},{"ar":"تَرَىٰ","tr":"tarā","en":"you see","root":"رأي","lem":"رَأَى"},{"ar":"لَهُم","tr":"lahum","en":"of them"},{"ar":"مِّنۢ","tr":"min","en":"any"},{"ar":"بَاقِيَةٍۢ","tr":"bāqiyatin","en":"remains","root":"بقي","lem":"باقِيَة"}]},{"n":9,"juz":29,"ar":"وَجَآءَ فِرْعَوْنُ وَمَن قَبْلَهُۥ وَٱلْمُؤْتَفِكَـٰتُ بِٱلْخَاطِئَةِ","en":"And there came Pharaoh and those before him and the overturned cities with sin.","w":[{"ar":"وَجَآءَ","tr":"wajāa","en":"And came","root":"جيأ","lem":"جاءَ"},{"ar":"فِرْعَوْنُ","tr":"fir'ʿawnu","en":"Firaun"},{"ar":"وَمَن","tr":"waman","en":"and (those)"},{"ar":"قَبْلَهُۥ","tr":"qablahu","en":"before him","root":"قبل","lem":"قَبْل"},{"ar":"وَٱلْمُؤْتَفِكَـٰتُ","tr":"wal-mu'tafikātu","en":"and the overturned cities","root":"أفك","lem":"مُؤْتَفِكَة"},{"ar":"بِٱلْخَاطِئَةِ","tr":"bil-khāṭi-ati","en":"with sin","root":"خطأ","lem":"خاطِئَة"}]},{"n":10,"juz":29,"ar":"فَعَصَوْا۟ رَسُولَ رَبِّهِمْ فَأَخَذَهُمْ أَخْذَةً رَّابِيَةً","en":"And they disobeyed the messenger of their Lord, so He seized them with a seizure exceeding [in severity].","w":[{"ar":"فَعَصَوْا۟","tr":"faʿaṣaw","en":"And they disobeyed","root":"عصي","lem":"عَصا"},{"ar":"رَسُولَ","tr":"rasūla","en":"(the) Messenger","root":"رسل","lem":"رَسُول"},{"ar":"رَبِّهِمْ","tr":"rabbihim","en":"(of) their Lord","root":"ربب","lem":"رَبّ"},{"ar":"فَأَخَذَهُمْ","tr":"fa-akhadhahum","en":"so He seized them","root":"أخذ","lem":"أَخَذَ"},{"ar":"أَخْذَةًۭ","tr":"akhdhatan","en":"(with) a seizure","root":"أخذ","lem":"أَخْذ"},{"ar":"رَّابِيَةً","tr":"rābiyatan","en":"exceeding","root":"ربو","lem":"رابِيَة"}]},{"n":11,"juz":29,"ar":"إِنَّا لَمَّا طَغَا ٱلْمَآءُ حَمَلْنَـٰكُمْ فِى ٱلْجَارِيَةِ","en":"Indeed, when the water overflowed, We carried you [i.e., your ancestors] in the sailing ship","w":[{"ar":"إِنَّا","tr":"innā","en":"Indeed, We"},{"ar":"لَمَّا","tr":"lammā","en":"when"},{"ar":"طَغَا","tr":"ṭaghā","en":"overflowed","root":"طغي","lem":"طَغَى"},{"ar":"ٱلْمَآءُ","tr":"l-māu","en":"the water","root":"موه","lem":"ماء"},{"ar":"حَمَلْنَـٰكُمْ","tr":"ḥamalnākum","en":"We carried you","root":"حمل","lem":"حَمَلَ"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"in"},{"ar":"ٱلْجَارِيَةِ","tr":"l-jāriyati","en":"the sailing (ship)","root":"جري","lem":"جارِيَة"}]},{"n":12,"juz":29,"ar":"لِنَجْعَلَهَا لَكُمْ تَذْكِرَةً وَتَعِيَهَآ أُذُنٌ وَٰعِيَةٌ","en":"That We might make it for you a reminder and [that] a conscious ear would be conscious of it.","w":[{"ar":"لِنَجْعَلَهَا","tr":"linajʿalahā","en":"That We might make it","root":"جعل","lem":"جَعَلَ"},{"ar":"لَكُمْ","tr":"lakum","en":"for you"},{"ar":"تَذْكِرَةًۭ","tr":"tadhkiratan","en":"a reminder","root":"ذكر","lem":"تَذْكِرَة"},{"ar":"وَتَعِيَهَآ","tr":"wataʿiyahā","en":"and would be conscious of it","root":"وعي","lem":"تَعِيَ"},{"ar":"أُذُنٌۭ","tr":"udhunun","en":"an ear","root":"أذن","lem":"أُذُن"},{"ar":"وَٰعِيَةٌۭ","tr":"wāʿiyatun","en":"conscious","root":"وعي","lem":"واعِيَة"}]},{"n":13,"juz":29,"ar":"فَإِذَا نُفِخَ فِى ٱلصُّورِ نَفْخَةٌ وَٰحِدَةٌ","en":"Then when the Horn is blown with one blast","w":[{"ar":"فَإِذَا","tr":"fa-idhā","en":"Then when"},{"ar":"نُفِخَ","tr":"nufikha","en":"is blown","root":"نفخ","lem":"نَفَخَ"},{"ar":"فِى","tr":"fī","en":"in"},{"ar":"ٱلصُّورِ","tr":"l-ṣūri","en":"the trumpet ","root":"صور","lem":"صُور"},{"ar":"نَفْخَةٌۭ","tr":"nafkhatun","en":"a blast","root":"نفخ","lem":"نَفْخَة"},{"ar":"وَٰحِدَةٌۭ","tr":"wāḥidatun","en":"single","root":"وحد","lem":"واحِدَة"}]},{"n":14,"juz":29,"ar":"وَحُمِلَتِ ٱلْأَرْضُ وَٱلْجِبَالُ فَدُكَّتَا دَكَّةً وَٰحِدَةً","en":"And the earth and the mountains are lifted and leveled with one blow [i.e., stroke] -","w":[{"ar":"وَحُمِلَتِ","tr":"waḥumilati","en":"And are lifted","root":"حمل","lem":"حَمَلَ"},{"ar":"ٱلْأَرْضُ","tr":"l-arḍu","en":"the earth","root":"أرض","lem":"أَرْض"},{"ar":"وَٱلْجِبَالُ","tr":"wal-jibālu","en":"and the mountains","root":"جبل","lem":"جَبَل"},{"ar":"فَدُكَّتَا","tr":"fadukkatā","en":