hat Day","root":"يوم","lem":"يَوْم"},{"ar":"ثَمَـٰنِيَةٌۭ","tr":"thamāniyatun","en":"eight","root":"ثمن","lem":"ثَمانِيَة"}]},{"n":18,"juz":29,"ar":"يَوْمَئِذٍ تُعْرَضُونَ لَا تَخْفَىٰ مِنكُمْ خَافِيَةٌ","en":"That Day, you will be exhibited [for judgement]; not hidden among you is anything concealed.","w":[{"ar":"يَوْمَئِذٍۢ","tr":"yawma-idhin","en":"That Day","root":"يوم","lem":"يَوْم"},{"ar":"تُعْرَضُونَ","tr":"tuʿ'raḍūna","en":"you will be exhibited","root":"عرض","lem":"عَرَضَ"},{"ar":"لَا","tr":"lā","en":"not"},{"ar":"تَخْفَىٰ","tr":"takhfā","en":"will be hidden","root":"خفي","lem":"يَخْفَى"},{"ar":"مِنكُمْ","tr":"minkum","en":"among you"},{"ar":"خَافِيَةٌۭ","tr":"khāfiyatun","en":"any secret","root":"خفي","lem":"خافِيَة"}]},{"n":19,"juz":29,"ar":"فَأَمَّا مَنْ أُوتِىَ كِتَـٰبَهُۥ بِيَمِينِهِۦ فَيَقُولُ هَآؤُمُ ٱقْرَءُوا۟ كِتَـٰبِيَهْ","en":"So as for he who is given his record in his right hand, he will say, \"Here, read my record!","w":[{"ar":"فَأَمَّا","tr":"fa-ammā","en":"Then as for"},{"ar":"مَنْ","tr":"man","en":"(him) who"},{"ar":"أُوتِىَ","tr":"ūtiya","en":"is given","root":"أتي","lem":"آتَى"},{"ar":"كِتَـٰبَهُۥ","tr":"kitābahu","en":"his record","root":"كتب","lem":"كِتاب"},{"ar":"بِيَمِينِهِۦ","tr":"biyamīnihi","en":"in his right hand","root":"يمن","lem":"يَمِين"},{"ar":"فَيَقُولُ","tr":"fayaqūlu","en":"will say","root":"قول","lem":"قالَ"},{"ar":"هَآؤُمُ","tr":"hāumu","en":"Here","root":"هاء","lem":"هاؤُم"},{"ar":"ٱقْرَءُوا۟","tr":"iq'raū","en":"read","root":"قرأ","lem":"قَرَأَ"},{"ar":"كِتَـٰبِيَهْ","tr":"kitābiyah","en":"my record","root":"كتب","lem":"كِتاب"}]},{"n":20,"juz":29,"ar":"إِنِّى ظَنَنتُ أَنِّى مُلَـٰقٍ حِسَابِيَهْ","en":"Indeed, I was certain that I would be meeting my account.\"","w":[{"ar":"إِنِّى","tr":"innī","en":"Indeed, I"},{"ar":"ظَنَنتُ","tr":"ẓanantu","en":"was certain","root":"ظنن","lem":"ظَنَّ"},{"ar":"أَنِّى","tr":"annī","en":"that I"},{"ar":"مُلَـٰقٍ","tr":"mulāqin","en":"(will) meet","root":"لقي","lem":"مُلاق"},{"ar":"حِسَ